<h1 class="mb-3">Law Enforcement: Your Legal Protection</h1>
<p class="lead">Domestic violence is a crime in Malaysia. The law provides ways to protect victims quickly.</p>

<h2 class="mt-4">Domestic Violence Act 1994 (Act 521)</h2>
<p>
  This is the main law dealing with domestic violence. It was amended in 2017, which added a faster
  type of protection for victims, the Emergency Protection Order.
</p>

<div class="row g-3 mt-2">
  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
    <div class="card h-100 border-danger shadow-sm">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="text-danger">Emergency Protection Order (EPO)</h5>
        <p><strong>Issued by:</strong> Social welfare officers</p>
        <p>Gives immediate protection, including outside office hours such as weekends. It is valid for about a week.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
    <div class="card h-100 border-warning shadow-sm">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="text-warning">Interim Protection Order (IPO)</h5>
        <p><strong>Issued by:</strong> The court</p>
        <p>A short-term order while the police investigation into the abuse is ongoing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
    <div class="card h-100 border-primary shadow-sm">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="text-primary">Protection Order (PO)</h5>
        <p><strong>Issued by:</strong> The court</p>
        <p>A longer-term order that restricts the abuser from harming the victim.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 class="mt-5">What You Can Do</h2>
<ol class="list-group list-group-numbered mb-4">
  <li class="list-group-item">In immediate danger, call <strong>999</strong>.</li>
  <li class="list-group-item">Lodge a police report at the nearest police station.</li>
  <li class="list-group-item">Seek medical attention and ask the doctor to document your injuries.</li>
  <li class="list-group-item">Ask the police or a welfare officer about protection orders.</li>
  <li class="list-group-item">Keep evidence such as photos, messages and medical reports in a safe place.</li>
</ol>

<div class="alert alert-secondary">
  This page is general information, not legal advice. For your own case, speak to a lawyer or a legal aid service.
</div>